      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ],
      "chapter": "Intro"
    },
    {
      "id": "b02",
      "narration": "Today we're testing the Nether mod: how to get there, what's waiting inside, and whether it's worth installing.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "title",
        "props": {
          "title": "Nether Mod Review",
          "kicker": "Luanti mod review",
          "subtitle": "Portals, lava seas and fast travel"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b03",
      "narration": "Getting there starts with a portal. You need fourteen blocks of obsidian, built into a frame four blocks wide and five blocks tall, standing upright like a doorway.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 10.5,
          "speed": 1.2,
          "label": "Nether Portal",
          "sublabel": "14 obsidian, 4 x 5 frame"
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ],
      "chapter": "Building the portal"
    },
    {
      "id": "b04",
      "narration": "Then you light it by right-clicking the frame with a mese crystal fragment, and the inside fills with a swirling purple wormhole.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 23.0,
          "zoom": 1.0,
          "zoom_to": 1.25,
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.42
          ],
          "label": "Light it",
          "sublabel": "Right-click with a mese crystal fragment"
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b05",
      "narration": "Step inside, wait a few seconds, and the mod pulls you deep underground.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 31.0,
          "zoom": 1.0,
          "zoom_to": 1.1
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b06",
      "narration": "By default, the Nether begins five thousand blocks below the surface and goes all the way down to minus eleven thousand.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "stat",
        "props": {
          "value": 5000,
          "label": "blocks below the surface",
          "note": "where the Nether begins (default setting)"
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ],
      "chapter": "Inside the Nether"
    },
    {
      "id": "b07",
      "narration": "The first thing you notice is the dark.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 52.6,
          "label": "Netherrack and glowstone",
          "speed": 0.7,
          "brightness": 1.9
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5: nodes.lua (Lava Crust: walkable, damage_per_second = 2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b07b",
      "narration": "These caves are carved out of netherrack, and lit only by glowstone and lava.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "kinetic",
        "props": {
          "lines": [
            "Netherrack caves,",
            "lit by glowstone and lava"
          ],
          "emphasis": [
            "glowstone",
            "lava"
          ]
        }
      },
      "cues": [
        "carved out of netherrack",
        "lit only by"
      ],
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5: nodes.lua (Lava Crust: walkable, damage_per_second = 2)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b08",
      "narration": "Then the tunnels open up into huge lava seas, covered by a glowing crust. Break it, and there's real lava underneath.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 58.6,
          "zoom": 1.0,
          "zoom_to": 1.12,
          "label": "Lava Crust",
          "speed": 0.6
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5: nodes.lua (Lava Crust: walkable, damage_per_second = 2)"
      ],
      "cues": [
        "lava seas"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b09",
      "narration": "You can walk on that crust, but it hurts you every second you stand on it.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "kinetic",
        "props": {
          "lines": [
            "You can walk on it.",
            "But it burns."
          ],
          "emphasis": [
            "burns"
          ]
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5: nodes.lua (Lava Crust: walkable, damage_per_second = 2)"
      ],
      "cues": [
        "walk on that crust",
        "hurts you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b10",
      "narration": "Which is exactly how I ended up taking a lava bath.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "footage",
        "props": {
          "src": "footage/raw_nether.mp4",
          "in": 69.0,
          "badge": "CREATIVE MODE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b11",
      "narration": "The best feature is fast travel. Every block you walk in the Nether counts as eight on the surface, so a second portal can shortcut huge distances.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "comparison",
        "props": {
          "title": "Fast travel",
          "unit": "blocks",
          "left": {
            "label": "Walk in the Nether",
            "value": 10
          },
          "right": {
            "label": "Distance on the surface",
            "value": 80
          }
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5 (Luanti): init.lua, portal definition",
        "nether mod 3.5: settingtypes.txt"
      ],
      "cues": [
        "Every block",
        "eight on the surface"
      ],
      "chapter": "Fast travel"
    },
    {
      "id": "b12",
      "narration": "There's more to find: nether brick and basalt for building, crystal geodes, a full set of nether tools, and a staff of light that turns netherrack into glowstone.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "list",
        "props": {
          "title": "Also in the mod",
          "items": [
            "Nether brick and basalt",
            "Crystal geodes",
            "Nether tools",
            "Staff of Light"
          ]
        }
      },
      "sources": [
        "nether mod 3.5: tools.lua, nodes.lua"
      ],
      "cues": [
        "nether brick",
        "crystal geodes",
        "nether tools",
        "staff of light"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b13",
      "narration": "So, is it worth it? I'd give it eight out of ten: a real new dimension, fast travel, great building blocks, and it's free. The downsides: it's very dark, and on slower computers the first trip loads slowly.",
      "visual": {
        "template": "verdict",
        "props": {
          "score": 8,
          "pros": [
            "A whole new dimension",
            "Fast travel, x8",
            "Free and open source"
          ],
          "cons": [
            "Very dark without lights",
            "Slow first load"
          ]
        }
      },
      "cues": [
        "eight out of ten",
